{
  "name": "slot-hack",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts",
  "totalSeconds": 94.991,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Imagine a phone that tells you the exact moment to hit spin on a slot machine.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/01.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.804,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "55253ad29ad4"
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In June twenty fourteen, a man in a St. Louis casino had one.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/02.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.259,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "1d3365177d72"
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "He held it close to the screen.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/03.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.163,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "1d3365177d72"
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "His finger hovered over the button, then jabbed it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/04.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.391,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "1d3365177d72"
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "He won just over twenty-one thousand dollars.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/05.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.098,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "1d3365177d72"
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The casino's machines had paid out more than they took in, with no big jackpot.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/06.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.774,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "1d3365177d72"
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02b",
      "gapAfter": 0.8,
      "text": "And nobody had touched them.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/07.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.235,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "8a3808aa3cce"
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The trail led to Russia.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/08.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.198,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "2133431496bc"
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In twenty oh nine, Russia banned almost all gambling.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/09.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.678,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "2133431496bc"
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Casinos had to sell thousands of slot machines cheap.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/10.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.902,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "2133431496bc"
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Some went to a team in St. Petersburg.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/11.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.709,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "2133431496bc"
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Not to play.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/12.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.654,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "2133431496bc"
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "To study the code.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/13.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.153,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "2133431496bc"
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Every slot machine runs on a random number generator.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/14.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.535,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "9d173ea7b0f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "But it isn't truly random.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/15.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.578,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "9d173ea7b0f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "It's a formula, fed by the machine's clock.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/16.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.157,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "9d173ea7b0f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Learn it, and you only need to find the machine's place in it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/17.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.322,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "9d173ea7b0f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So an agent films about two dozen spins and sends the video to St. Petersburg.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/18.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.798,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "f0387336e6ce"
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The team works out the pattern.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/19.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.446,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "f0387336e6ce"
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Then the phone buzzes, about a quarter of a second early, because that's how long a human needs to react.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/20.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.81,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "f0387336e6ce"
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "He doesn't choose when to spin.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/21.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.339,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "f0387336e6ce"
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.8,
      "text": "The phone does.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/22.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.802,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "f0387336e6ce"
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Agents kept each machine under a thousand dollars, so nobody would notice.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/23.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.957,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "de4fda6e8211"
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "One security expert says an agent usually won over ten thousand dollars a day.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/24.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.147,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "de4fda6e8211"
    },
    {
      "id": "25",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "A small team?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/25.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.693,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "de4fda6e8211"
    },
    {
      "id": "26",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "More than a quarter of a million a week.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/26.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.564,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "de4fda6e8211"
    },
    {
      "id": "27",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Ninety percent went back to St. Petersburg.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/27.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.939,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "de4fda6e8211"
    },
    {
      "id": "28",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "That December, the man from St. Louis came back.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/28.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.228,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "d879502d1a66"
    },
    {
      "id": "29",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "He and three others were arrested in Missouri.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/29.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.129,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "d879502d1a66"
    },
    {
      "id": "30",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The Russians each got two years in prison.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/30.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.957,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "d879502d1a66"
    },
    {
      "id": "31",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "But the man behind it, a mathematician known only as Alex, stayed in Russia.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/31.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.979,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "d879502d1a66"
    },
    {
      "id": "32",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So casinos threw those machines out, right?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/32.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.813,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "9b0fb01550eb"
    },
    {
      "id": "33",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.6,
      "text": "No.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/33.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.471,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "9b0fb01550eb"
    },
    {
      "id": "34",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "There was no easy fix, and keeping them was cheaper than replacing them.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/34.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.275,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "9b0fb01550eb"
    },
    {
      "id": "35",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Alex even offered to sell the maker the fix.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/35.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.432,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "9b0fb01550eb"
    },
    {
      "id": "36",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "His price ran to eight figures.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/36.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.617,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "9b0fb01550eb"
    },
    {
      "id": "37",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.8,
      "text": "The company said no.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/37.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.121,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "9b0fb01550eb"
    },
    {
      "id": "38",
      "scene": "s9",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Years later, more than a hundred thousand of that model were still on casino floors.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/38.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.995,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "391edbed9c6d"
    },
    {
      "id": "39",
      "scene": "s9",
      "take": "t99",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "So when a finger waits over the spin button, is it waiting for luck, or for a phone?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/slot-hack/39.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.869,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "ddd88419bea2"
    }
  ]
}
